usercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":114},{"title":"TopicAPIUtilsOOB - isValidCreateTopicPayload\\(Object topicObject, String schema, Array warnings\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicAPIUtilsOOBAPIScoped.md","line":178},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":235},{"title":"TopicAPIUtilsOOB - getCreateTopicSchema\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicAPIUtilsOOBAPIScoped.md","line":259},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":271},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":351},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":387},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":457},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":481},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":564},{"title":"Customize response","target":"t_CustomizeResponse","line":627},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":685},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":709},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":807},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/event_management_topic-api.md","line":831},{"title":"Event Management Topic Open API","target":"event_management_topic-api","line":903},{"title":"Customize response","target":"t_CustomizeResponse","line":904}],"metadata":{"title":"TopicAPIUtilsOOB - Scoped","description":"The TopicAPIUtilsOOB script include provides methods that are used when processing the Event Management Topic Open API endpoint.Inserts the information passed in the Event Management Topic Open API - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic endpoint into the Topic \\[sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\] table.Returns the defined schema for the payload used by the Event Management Topic Open API - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic endpoint to validate the topic payload.Validates the payload passed into the Event Management Topic Open API - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic endpoint. This validation is performed on the request body and the schema.Generates and returns the response to a Event Management Topic Open API - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic endpoint call.Processes the request made by the Event Management Topic Open API endpoint.Provides the ability to add custom data to the response object returned to the Event Management Topic Open API - POST /sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt/topic endpoint.Validates whether the topic name, header-query, content-query, and namespace combination passed in the Event Management Topic Open API endpoint payload is unique.Validates the topic external ID passed in the request body of the Event Management Topic Open API endpoint.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicAPIUtilsOOBAPIScoped.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":13,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[62,70],[112,119],[142,150],[170,182],[205,237],[245,298],[321,353],[361,408],[418,423],[451,483],[491,512],[522,527],[534,566],[574,607],[617,622],[640,644],[653,687],[695,736],[777,809],[817,858]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicAPIUtilsOOBAPIScoped.md"},
